  <p id="c-taipingyulan-143-hejingying:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-taipingyulan-143-hejingying:p001:m0000" ref="iop_ybd_afm">蕭昭業</persName><persName id="c-taipingyulan-143-hejingying:p001:m0003" ref="pbz_pni_tco_AA">何妃</persName></p>
  <p id="c-taipingyulan-143-hejingying:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">蕭子顯《齊書》曰：<persName id="c-taipingyulan-143-hejingying:p002:m0009" ref="pbz_pni_tco_AA">郁林王何妃</persName>，名<persName id="c-taipingyulan-143-hejingying:p002:m0016" ref="pbz_pni_tco_AA">婧英</persName>，廬江適人，撫軍將軍<persName id="c-taipingyulan-143-hejingying:p002:m0028" ref="pbz_pni_tco_A">戢</persName>之女。後將拜，鏡在床無因墮地。其冬，與<persName id="c-taipingyulan-143-hejingying:p002:m0048" ref="m9u_v4i_tk5">太后</persName>同日謁太廟。後禀性淫亂，爲妃時，與外奸通。左右<persName id="c-taipingyulan-143-hejingying:p002:m0073" ref="ur2_4yl_xwz">楊瑉之</persName>與同寢處如伉儷，又與帝相愛褻，故帝恣之。迎後親戚入宮，賞賜人數十萬，以<persName id="c-taipingyulan-143-hejingying:p002:m0111" ref="kix_r92_2ed">世祖</persName>耀靈殿處後家屬。帝被廢，貶爲王妃。</p>
</text>
